    <aside></aside>  <!-- spacing -->

    <section class="grid-third index-advocacy-section">

        <div>
            <h2 class="right">ALL<br> ABOUT<br> YOUR<br> RIGHTS</h2>
        </div>

        <p class="lowercase justify twothird">
            cryptee doesn't just build privacy tools, we fight for your digital rights.
            alongside the world's most respected civil liberties organizations,
            we challenge surveillance legislation, trying our best to hold big tech accountable and protect encryption.

            <br><br>

            our coalition work and advocacy spans organizations like
            <a href="http://open-web-advocacy.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Open Web Advocacy</a>
            <a href="https://eff.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">EFF</a>,
            <a href="https://edri.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">EDRi</a>,
            <a href="https://privacyinternational.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Privacy International</a>,
            <a href="https://wikimedia.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Wikimedia Foundation</a>,
            <a href="https://www.article19.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Article 19</a>,
            <a href="https://fsf.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Free Software Foundation</a>,
            <a href="https://torproject.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">The Tor Project</a>,
            <a href="https://ccc.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Chaos Computer Club</a>,
            and privacy-first tech allies like
            <a href="https://mozilla.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Mozilla</a>,
            <a href="https://brave.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Brave</a>,
            <a href="https://vivaldi.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Vivaldi</a>,
            <a href="https://f-droid.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">F-Droid</a>,
            <a href="https://fastmail.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="external">Fastmail</a>
            among countless others.

            <br><br>

            from confronting apple at european commission hearings and forcing them to reverse their decision to kill web apps in the eu,
            to opposing surveillance legislation like the eu council's "going dark" proposals,
            defending the GDPR against deregulatory rollbacks,
            publishing security research adopted by the EFF,
            and keeping android open,
            we put our name on the line for your digital rights.

            <br><br>

            <a href="/activism-advocacy-research" class="bold">more about our advocacy work &amp; research</a>
        </p>

    </section>

